    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Heritage is a Time-Travel RPG Adventure in which players step into the shoes of Ethan, a young archaeologist, on a journey across time. As players explore historical eras, every decision carries weight, altering alliances, uncovering secrets, and reshaping the timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in visceral combat, decode ancient puzzles, and wield the power of the Amulet to get guidance on your journey. Dynamic weather,  and evolving environments immerse players in worlds that react to their actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every choice has a consequence will you preserve history or risk\u00a0unraveling\u00a0it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In London, young archaeologist Ethan uncovers a dusty book among his late grandfather\u2019s belongings. Its cover mirrors the design of the amulet he\u2019s worn all his life. When he places the amulet on the book, a blinding light erupts, the room collapses, and a vortex pulls him into a realm outside of time\u2014a crossroads where history collides, guarded by a dark force.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided by his grandfather\u2019s notes, Ethan navigates ancient ruins, unlocking a hidden relic that hurls him into the Old Testament era, stranded and alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/65892d6d821bf6fd7c73ca21dc62a6a6.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/65892d6d821bf6fd7c73ca21dc62a6a6.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/65892d6d821bf6fd7c73ca21dc62a6a6.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With each era he traverses, the amulet reveals its connection to the Ark of the Covenant, glowing near artifacts tied to his family\u2019s legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As Ethan edges closer to the Ark\u2019s true resting place, he faces a powerful choice: expose its secrets to the world or keep them hidden to protect humanity. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ethan\u2019s journey isn\u2019t just about finding his way home it\u2019s about understanding the timeless threads that connect us all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cWe all share the same roots. We are all one.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e299b4c8b2a56fe778f664397f5ec20b.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/7c32ab10d578962ec74099ca4722d6f4.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience hand-crafted historical eras, each with deep lore, living NPCs, and game-changing decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/11d12410c9c750c964ddf76b1651c7f3.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in visceral melee and ranged combat inspired by legendary warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/cc18018d504d677c45e3f7e4d65549ca.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span>Rewind key moments, correct mistakes, and explore alternate outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/4a8398c612473d242a7a8748c50ce26b.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient cities, hidden temples, and war-torn battlefields in cinematic detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/231dd1752a71afc3e9dd2b09e473491d.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher ancient texts, unlock hidden chambers, and recover lost artifacts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/22b71172a5b838332fbf0aa06b6829f1.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions alter alliances, reshape historical events, and impact your legacy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/ce67c6c48c50b9a04a81773d41fd76c5.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two journeys are the same different choices lead to unique outcomes and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is fragile. <strong>Will you protect the past, or watch it fall apart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/4581fc5c77cff704fc7651ee283bfd7a.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Find Your Way Home Without Breaking History?\u00a0</strong>Every hero needs help. Every moment counts. And history doesn\u2019t always go as planned. <strong>Will you preserve the timeline or become its greatest threat?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/c01d36e690b90331196769dc1b9a189b.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Heritage is a Time-Travel RPG Adventure in which players step into the shoes of Ethan, a young archaeologist, on a journey across time. As players explore historical eras, every decision carries weight, altering alliances, uncovering secrets, and reshaping the timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in visceral combat, decode ancient puzzles, and wield the power of the Amulet to get guidance on your journey. Dynamic weather,  and evolving environments immerse players in worlds that react to their actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every choice has a consequence will you preserve history or risk\u00a0unraveling\u00a0it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e6a1969c98e0e1882c4ba90d1b1d6627.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></