graph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.poster.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.webm?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/0baea48435d40d6afb71fe723d0001a6.mp4?t=1748774340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/e299b4c8b2a56fe778f664397f5ec20b.avif?t=1748774340\" width=608 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/7c32ab10d578962ec74099ca4722d6f4.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience hand-crafted historical eras, each with deep lore, living NPCs, and game-changing decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/11d12410c9c750c964ddf76b1651c7f3.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in visceral melee and ranged combat inspired by legendary warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/cc18018d504d677c45e3f7e4d65549ca.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span>Rewind key moments, correct mistakes, and explore alternate outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/4a8398c612473d242a7a8748c50ce26b.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient cities, hidden temples, and war-torn battlefields in cinematic detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/231dd1752a71afc3e9dd2b09e473491d.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher ancient texts, unlock hidden chambers, and recover lost artifacts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/22b71172a5b838332fbf0aa06b6829f1.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions alter alliances, reshape historical events, and impact your legacy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/ce67c6c48c50b9a04a81773d41fd76c5.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two journeys are the same different choices lead to unique outcomes and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is fragile. <strong>Will you protect the past, or watch it fall apart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/4581fc5c77cff704fc7651ee283bfd7a.webp?t=1748774340\" width=609 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Find Your Way Home Without Breaking History?\u00a0</strong>Every hero needs help. Every moment counts. And history doesn\u2019t always go as planned. <strong>Will you preserve the timeline or become its greatest threat?</strong></p>